{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳展鵬與單文柔（Phoebe）婚後育有愛女「小豬比」Quinta，一家三口生活甜蜜溫馨，Phoebe不時在社交平台分享親子日常，日前她分享了帶同女兒Quinta出海乘搭古色古香帆船的靚相，重溫老公陳展鵬當年拍攝無綫劇集《張保仔》的時光。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:21:34.096908+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T03:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:29.849227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:18:29.849227+00:00","content_hash":"82196937f55e69e18f1f4342616f68900374422ab7878f16bc9a2caf034f17df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}